About MOBEN&ROOSTER
MOBEN&ROOSTER supports industrial clients on high-value technical projects by providing experienced engineers who operate at the heart of engineering, coordination and project performance challenges.
Joining MOBEN&ROOSTER means becoming part of a community of highly skilled engineering specialists, combining technical expertise with strong human relationships to contribute to tomorrow’s industrial projects.
As part of international offshore pipeline installation projects, MOBEN&ROOSTER is looking for a Senior Project Engineer – Installation Methods to support projects and tenders, from the early engineering stages through to offshore execution.
Your Responsibilities
• Lead engineering activities related to pipeline installation methods on international projects;

• Support project scopes from early engagement with internal and external clients through to offshore execution on board installation vessels;

• Define appropriate installation methods for Reel-Lay, S-Lay and J-Lay operations;

• Prepare installation method statements, procedures and technical documentation required for offshore operations;

• Perform installation rigging calculations and contribute to rigging design;

• Provide technical expertise on pipeline installation matters;

• Contribute to subcontractor selection and technical follow-up;

• Support procurement activities and follow up the fabrication and testing of installation aids;

